Subject: [PATCH v5 21/22] gstreamer1.0-plugins-good: on wayland qt5 needs qtwayland
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2020 14:28:05 +0000
Message-Id: <20201029142806.1830504-22-quaresma.jose@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.29.1
In-Reply-To: <20201029142806.1830504-1-quaresma.jose@gmail.com>
